stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Inventoried: scan all versions
  Inventoried --> CapabilityChecked: capability evidence
  CapabilityChecked --> Blocked: unsupported WORM / KMS / version
  CapabilityChecked --> DryRunReviewed: compatible
  DryRunReviewed --> Approved: dual approval
  Approved --> InitialCopy
  InitialCopy --> DeltaCatchup
  DeltaCatchup --> Verify
  Verify --> WriteFence: manifest/checksum passes
  Verify --> Blocked: mismatch
  WriteFence --> FinalDelta
  FinalDelta --> RouteCutover: Raft route_epoch CAS
  FinalDelta --> Blocked: untracked writes
  RouteCutover --> Observe
  Observe --> Completed: signed evidence
  Observe --> ReverseCatchup: rollback requested AND new writes exist
  ReverseCatchup --> WriteFence: reverse verified before route-CAS back
  InitialCopy --> Paused: 429 / 503
  DeltaCatchup --> Paused: retryable
  Paused --> InitialCopy: checkpoint resume
  Blocked --> [*]: manual decision
  Completed --> [*]
